// Article 1. Creation: the parties and the trust fund.
Fact person Identified by Margaret, Daniel, Anna, Ben
Role settlor For person Is Margaret
Role beneficiary For person Where person == Anna || person == Ben
Var fund : USD
Bool in-force
Fact deceased Identified by person
Event death Related to person Creates deceased(person)

Act settle Actor settlor Related to amount : USD
  Holds when !in-force
  Creates in-force, fund(amount)

Clause 1.1/1 => settlor, fund, in-force, settle
Clause 1.1/2 Definition => settlor.
